Stephen A. Nelson. Petrology, Tulane EENS 2120, Spring 2018 public course site. [Author/institutional notes and syllabus](https://www2.tulane.edu/~sanelson/eens212/).

Read the complete published lecture-note programme alongside the book, including textures/classification, thermodynamics/phase relations, igneous processes, metamorphic reactions, triangular plots, and rock interpretation. The site distinguishes updated 2018 notes and contains dated announcements. Some material is referenced through the campus Canvas system and is not assumed publicly available.

Freely readable notes are established; no blanket open-adaptation licence is asserted. Preserve actual authorship, dates, credits, and notices before reuse. Course identity, public content categories, edition distinctions, and access checked on 29 October 2026. No private course access, notes, images, or external media is bundled.

